# Third-party brand/trademark icons (Apple, Airbnb, Alipay, Android, App Store, Behance, …).
# Excluded deliberately: this repository is public, the icon set arrived with no licence, and those
# marks carry usage restrictions of their own. The rsync in src/icons/README.md will repopulate this
# directory on a re-sync — this rule is what stops it silently re-entering git.
src/icons/library/brands/

